      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s historic Murray Hall, built in 1877, now serves as a museum and reception space and is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
